  {
   "identifier": "newsletter_baukasten-text",
   "id": "doc-1jjjj4pqs0",
   "content": {
    "text": "Werner M. from K. writes that the author Georges Simenon has his Inspector Maigret feel at home in one of his novels in a place where wine is drunk from earthenware vessels. <a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://bellevue.nzz.ch/kochen-geniessen/wein/wein-aus-tonkruegen-trinken-empfehlenswert-oder-nicht-ld.1935118\">Is that something worth emulating, or should one refrain from doing so?</a>"
   },
   "paidContent": true,
   "prevElement": "newsletter_baukasten-image",
   "nextElement": "newsletter_baukasten-subtitle"
  },
  {
   "identifier": "newsletter_baukasten-subtitle",
   "id": "doc-1jjjj3sfg0",
   "content": {
    "title": "From Burgundy to Châteauneuf-du-Pape: Wines that leave a lasting impression"
   },
   "paidContent": true,
   "prevElement": "newsletter_baukasten-text",
   "nextElement": "newsletter_baukasten-image"
  },
  {
   "identifier": "newsletter_baukasten-image",
   "id": "doc-1jjjj3ubn0",
   "content": {
    "image": {
     "originalUrl": "https://nzzprod-endpoint-cue7enfnfqc8ekg7.a03.azurefd.net/images/2026/09/01/8a48ac30-c09b-4f27-99dc-f0bc5d873bf4.jpg",
     "mediaId": "0POGEmSFqJv1",
     "key": "2026/09/01/8a48ac30-c09b-4f27-99dc-f0bc5d873bf4.jpg",
     "width": 4032,
     "height": 3024,
     "mimeType": "image/jpeg",
     "imageService": "fastly",
     "url": "https://img-msp-prod.nzz.ch/2026/09/01/8a48ac30-c09b-4f27-99dc-f0bc5d873bf4.jpg?width=1024&quality=75&auto=webp"
    },
    "source": "PD"
   },
   "paidContent": true,
   "prevElement": "newsletter_baukasten-subtitle",
   "nextElement": "newsletter_baukasten-text"
  },
  {
   "identifier": "newsletter_baukasten-text",
   "id": "doc-1jjjj419c0",
   "content": {
    "text": "Anyone traveling by boat on the Saône and Rhône rivers will pass by four different French wine regions. I enjoyed some wine highlights in southern Burgundy, Beaujolais, and the northern and southern Rhône valleys. These are my five favorites."
   },
   "data": {},
   "paidContent": true,
   "prevElement": "newsletter_baukasten-image",
   "nextElement": "newsletter_baukasten-subtitle"
  },
  {
   "identifier": "newsletter_baukasten-subtitle",
   "id": "doc-1jjjj31iv0",
   "content": {
    "title": "Which Spanish wines belong in a good wine cellar?"
