    "source": "Nathan Blackaby / Unsplash"
   },
   "styles": {
    "image-style": "baukasten-image-portrait"
   },
   "paidContent": true,
   "prevElement": "newsletter_baukasten-subtitle",
   "nextElement": "newsletter_baukasten-text"
  },
  {
   "identifier": "newsletter_baukasten-text",
   "id": "doc-1jjjj359i0",
   "content": {
    "text": "Maria P. from L. writes that Spain is one of the most diverse wine-growing countries and asks: <a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://bellevue.nzz.ch/kochen-geniessen/wein/welche-spanischen-weine-gehoeren-in-jeden-weinkeller-ld.1934598\">Which wines should one absolutely have in their portfolio? What tips do you recommend?</a>"
   },
   "paidContent": true,
   "prevElement": "newsletter_baukasten-image",
   "nextElement": "newsletter_baukasten-subtitle"
  },
  {
   "identifier": "newsletter_baukasten-subtitle",
   "id": "doc-1jjjj54ru0",
   "content": {
    "title": "Vineyards, restaurants and an idyllic château: The wine paradise on Mont Vully"
   },
   "paidContent": true,
   "prevElement": "newsletter_baukasten-text",
   "nextElement": "newsletter_baukasten-image"
  },
  {
   "identifier": "newsletter_baukasten-image",
